    "titulo": "A car<br/><strong>we have known<br/>for more than a decade.</strong>",
    "parrafos": [
      "This <strong>Porsche 911 Carrera 3.2 Coupé</strong> comes from a private collection. Built on <strong>9 September 1983</strong> as a <strong>1984</strong> model year car, it pairs the naturally aspirated 3.2-litre flat-six with a five-speed manual gearbox and <strong>Slate Blue</strong> paintwork.",
      "In <strong>2015</strong>, at around <strong>45,000 km</strong>, we sold it into another collection. <strong>Ten years later</strong> the car is back at Valentin Motors with <strong>48,200 km</strong>: barely 3,000 km in a whole decade."
