    "parrafos": [
      "The <strong>930/20</strong> engine is the air-cooled, <strong>3,164 cc</strong> flat-six that the Carrera 3.2 introduced in 1984, with injection and ignition managed electronically by the DME. From the factory, this car adds an <strong>emissions optimisation control unit</strong> (code 154), linked to its Swedish-market specification.",
      "The gearbox is the <strong>915/67</strong> five-speed manual, the final generation of the 915 before the arrival of the G50. The chassis runs <strong>sports dampers</strong> front and rear (code 474)."
    ],
